$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (S,E)-ethyl 4-(tert-butoxycarbonylamino)-2-fluoro-5-methylhex-2- enoate
(11): Synthesized via a modified literature procedure (S3). A solution of
(S)-methyl 2-(tert-butoxycarbonylamino)-3-methylbutanoate (3.24 g, 14.00
mmol, 1.0 equiv) in toluene (60 mL) at -78 ºC was added a 1.0 M solution
of diisobutylaluminum hydride in hexanes (28.0 mL, 28.00 mmol, 2.0 equiv)
dropwise. The reaction was then allowed to stir for 3 h at -78 ºC at
which point it was quenched with AcOH (10 mL) and then warmed slowly to
room temperature.
